# Security Best Practices

## 16. Security Groups

ALB Security Group:

```
Allow:
80 HTTP
443 HTTPS
```

EC2 Security Group:

```
Allow:
Traffic only from ALB Security Group
```

Never expose EC2 directly.

---

# Monitoring

## 17. CloudWatch Metrics

Load Balancer:

